# Guessing Game

## Project Name
Guessing Game

## Language
Python

## Description
A simple console-based number guessing game written in Python.

The computer randomly generates a secret number between 1 and 100.
The player has to guess the number.

The program gives hints:
- Too High – when the guess is greater than the secret number.
- Too Low – when the guess is smaller than the secret number.
- Correct – when the player guesses the secret number.

The program also counts the number of attempts.

## How to Run

1. Make sure Python is installed on your computer.
2. Clone or download this repository.
3. Open the project folder in VS Code or a terminal.
4. Run the following command:

```bash
python guessing_game.py
